          },
          "body": "Hey David,\n\nThanks a lot for the patch!\n\nCan you attach it to a new issue though? It helps with tracking in CHANGES.txt and svn.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markrmiller%40gmail.com",
            "name": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "key": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
